WEBVTT

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:09.690
Onii-chan...

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.740
It's just the two of us tonight.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.450
I've been waiting forever for this day.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:21.290
So, what do you want to do next?

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.870
What do I want? Well...

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.630
Hey, hold on, this isn't right!

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:28.340
And what's with "That's a secret?"

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.540
There's such a thing as being too suggestive.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.530
You still can't decide? It's easy!

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.460
Just do whatever you want the most.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.720
Well, Onii-chan?

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.230
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.550
Lift up your foot!

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:46.230
Sure.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:57.180
Just because Mum and Dad aren't here
doesn't mean you can loaf around all day!

00:00:58.610 --> 00:00:59.740
That's right.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.500
I'll be alone with Nao until tomorrow morning.

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.500
I have a feeling...

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.050
...that it's going to be a long day.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.940
It looks like we have all the ingredients.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.360
I'll have my brother all to myself the entire night.

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.740
Sorry for the short notice.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:06.120
We should be back by tomorrow evening.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:10.750
For dinner you can order out, make it yourselves, or whatever you like.

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:11.750
Take care.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:12.790
OK!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.630
OK, have a good trip.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:20.510
Shuusuke! Don't think you can run amok while we're out!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:21.550
Understood!

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:24.510
Take care of the house while we're gone.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:33.020
He doesn't seem the least bit bothered
about us being alone together.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.900
So, what do you want to do?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:37.900
Why did I have that dream?

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:40.090
Nao's your sister. You idiot! Fool!

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:44.070
I just have to stop focusing on the fact that we're alone!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:45.620
I've got to start pretending otherwise!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:48.660
Mum and Dad are actually home! Yeah, it's a perfectly normal Sunday!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:49.700
Just a normal day, just a normal...

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.210
Onii-chan?
Just a normal day, just a normal...

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.890
What should we do tonight?

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:55.330
What should we do?

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:59.250
I can cook something, or we can order out.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.260
Or do you want to go out to eat?

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.860
Oh, you're talking about dinner?

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:07.380
I took a look in the fridge, and it seemed pretty well-stocked.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:10.350
In that case, why don't I take care of dinner?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.270
Huh, you will?

00:04:13.270 --> 00:04:17.270
You've been cleaning the house all day, haven't you?

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:19.610
Let me at least make dinner.

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.980
Are you sure?

00:04:20.980 --> 00:04:22.110
Leave it to me.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:25.450
All right, why don't we have some good old fashioned curry?

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.120
I'll start boiling water so we can get cooking sooner.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:35.500
At times like these, I need to distract myself.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:42.170
Commencing Operation Onii-chan's Heart-Pounding, Sleepless Night: I'll Knock Him Half-Dead.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:45.840
First, I'll service him with a maid outfit.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:51.970
So, I guess I have all the ingredients.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.600
Onii-sama?

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.770
I finished cleaning the bath!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:00.150
What the– What's with that get-up?

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.570
Isn't it cute?

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.090
Could I help you with something?

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:09.090
Uh... Well, I guess you can wash the rice.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.080
At your service, Onii-sama!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:21.170
Only maid outfits can get him that worked up. WMDs have nothing on them!

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.860
Onii-chan, could you hold down the stool?

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.640
Hmm? Sure.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:35.560
The pot for the curry should be on this shelf... Oh, is this it?

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.580
No, I guess not. Let's see...

00:05:43.150 --> 00:05:45.030
Let me look for the pot!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:48.030
It's OK, I got it!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:54.330
Deep within that field of cabbages lies my horizontal-striped paradise!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:58.920
The uncharted path will open up like Moses parting the Red Sea.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.290
He's rapaciously devouring the view!

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:09.050
But this panty-flash is just an appetiser for Operation Onii-chan's Heart-Pounding,

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.430
Sleepless Night: I'll Knock Him Half-Dead.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.060
All right, I think that's enough for now.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:16.310
Three... Two... One...

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:19.190
Service time's over!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.850
I found the pot.

00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:22.980
O-Oh.

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.860
I'm making some potato salad, too.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.960
Do we have any more mayonnaise?

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:36.600
Um, I don't think so.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.910
I guess I'll make a run to the convenience store.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.120
Why don't we make some?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.680
Huh? You mean we can make our own mayonnaise?

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:45.000
Yeah, it's pretty easy.

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:52.300
All you have to do is to thoroughly mix eggs and vinegar.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:55.700
Then you add some salt and pepper for flavour.

00:06:55.700 --> 00:07:00.920
Then you carefully mix in salad oil, and you're done.

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:04.730
What is it?

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:08.760
I just thought that it's just like a girl to know these things.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:15.020
Uh, why don't you slowly pour in the oil while I mix it?

00:07:15.020 --> 00:07:15.740
Roger that.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.950
Slowly... Yes, just like that.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.080
This is how you help Mum out all the time, right, Nao?

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:27.710
Yup, I love cooking. I'm thrilled whenever someone says my food is delicious.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:35.720
Get a towel, quick!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.840
Got it! Just a se–

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.650
Sorry...

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.170
Are you all right, Nao?

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:56.410
Ow, it's in my eyes.

00:07:56.750 --> 00:08:00.450
Ah, me too. My eyes...

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:02.250
Let's rinse them out in the bathroom.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.670
OK.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:07.640
Ow!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.510
Wash your face first.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.010
OK.

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.050
Are you hurt anywhere? Any cuts or bruises?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.260
I'm fine.

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:19.930
Good.

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:24.230
Onii-chan...

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:27.480
My zipper is stuck.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:30.480
You want me to unzip it?

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.820
Calm down! Get a grip!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.070
Why am I getting all nervous over some stupid zipper?

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.840
Still stuck?

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:39.580
No, give me a minute.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:43.580
Crap, now I'm really nervous. Calm down and concentrate!

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.630
How long are you going to take?!

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:48.280
Forget it!

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:50.050
I'll do it myself!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.130
Oh, uh...

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.050
...sorry.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:03.140
Why am I feeling this tinge of fatigue?

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:07.980
Good!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:10.400
Sparkling clean!

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:13.900
Huh?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:16.160
Well, I guess I'll get out now.

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:17.450
Onii-chan!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:18.280
What? What is it?

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:22.950
I'm scared! I think I just heard someone in the house!

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.500
What? OK then!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.000
I'll check it out!

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:41.640
Oh my!

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.270
Shuu-chan, you're naked!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:48.560
Wait a minute, his parents took off in their car around noon.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:52.320
That means Shuu-chan and Nao-chan are all alone?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:55.280
What on Earth are they doing inside?

00:09:55.820 --> 00:09:56.990
Find anything?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.740
Nothing unusual.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.410
OK. Maybe it was just my imagination.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.600
Onii-chan, that's...

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.620
What?

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.790
I don't believe this! That's my face towel!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:15.520
This fluffy, highly-absorbent towel was my favourite!

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:18.630
I ordered this because of the penguin pattern! You're awful! How could you?!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:22.430
Now that I know where it's been, I can't wipe my face with it any more!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:24.560
Sorry! I screwed up!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:31.810
C-Crap!

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.990
If anyone were to see us like this...

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.290
Yes, who is it?

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:57.700
Onii-chan! This is the same creepy, heavy breathing I heard before!

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:02.260
What? All right, I'll give that sick bastard a piece of my mind!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.090
Who's there?

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.810
Captain? And you brought Yamashiro and Kurosaki along?

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.610
Hey Shuusuke, we've come to get you.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:22.780
Were you in the bathroom? You weren't answering your mobile.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:29.500
Don't tell me you forgot about the overnight jog we had planned.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:33.130
Ah, you mean for the monthly paper recycling day tomorrow?

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:34.290
Yeah!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:38.250
This is the night we've been impatiently waiting for,

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.670
where we go around town looking under the city's street lights,

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:44.890
in our quest to save the porno magazines which were abandoned by their masters.

00:11:45.290 --> 00:11:47.820
Last month we took in less than
half of our usual haul due to the rain.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.480
We're probably going to have
a lot of competition tonight.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:54.400
And since quantity beats quality,
you won't want to miss this.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:56.860
Tch!

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:59.280
Why the A.G.E. of all people?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:02.200
Huh, but I thought paper recycling day was...

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.320
Sorry but...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.120
...I can't go with you today.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:08.910
My parents are out, and they asked me to watch the house.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.790
Oh, so your parents aren't here?

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:15.920
So, that means tonight you'll be totally busy with your "solo activities"? You dog!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.460
No way!

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.800
Onii-chan? What's all the fuss?

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.550
We're asking him to come jogging with us.

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:25.340
You know how fall is meant for sports?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.260
It's also the season for fine art.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.060
But most importantly...

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:31.100
...it's a season for reading!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:35.530
And you know how Shuusuke really
enjoys autumn's Love Your Animals week.

00:12:35.530 --> 00:12:36.770
He is a man of many tastes.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.150
Moron! What are you saying?

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:41.820
Anyway, I'm sorry, but I'm going to have to pass.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:47.450
I hear you. A big brother can't go out leaving his little sister alone.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:50.910
That sounds weirdly suggestive
coming from a little sister fetishist like you.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.830
Why don't you go?

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:56.750
They came all the way here to get you, didn't they?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.420
Yeah, but...

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:01.550
I'll be fine. I'll keep the doors locked.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.130
Good going, Shuusuke.

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:05.310
All right, let's roll!

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:07.140
Uh, sure.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.100
I'll see you later!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.020
I won't be out too long.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:21.650
Why did this happen? This was supposed to be our night together.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:26.410
Nothing.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.740
Here too.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.080
Even here!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:34.080
This can't be happening.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:37.830
Sucker!

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:40.460
Once he finds out, he'll come back in no time!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:44.460
Buck up guys, this ain't over! They must have some at that Block Two apartment building!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:49.220
Right. You know that place is filled with a bunch of pathetic, single guys! Let's go!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.010
Yeah!

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:54.020
I can't let those two have the house to themselves!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:57.890
I can't even reach Shuu-chan's mobile!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.690
That was... Shuu-chan?

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:04.230
I see, he must be tired of being stuck inside with Nao-chan all day.

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:07.700
Wait, what are those guys doing?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:25.960
You gotta be kidding.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.790
What the hell?!

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:35.690
Ramen Marujuu! There should be a ton of old-man eromanga and pin-up magazines thrown out over there!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.600
Right, let's check it out!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.600
Yeah!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:46.180
What's going on?

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.280
I lost them!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.370
This way's a shortcut!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.750
Hold up! Guys, look at these notices!

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.630
Should we go home?

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.750
Yeah.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:15.390
It's close to 39 degrees!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.770
Seriously?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:27.320
Well, I'd obviously catch a cold, running around the house like that.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:42.400
Besides, I'm sure I'm being punished for leaving my sister behind, just to grab porno magazines.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.380
He went out of his way to make that.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.390
We'll eat it together tomorrow, when Mum and Dad come back.

00:15:58.260 --> 00:16:00.270
He's burning up.

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.020
Nao...

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.530
He said my name in his sleep.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.740
Onii-chan!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:20.130
Coming!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.910
And this was the perfect moment...

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.000
Good evening!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.460
Is Shuu-chan back?

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.000
He's sleeping in his bed.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.710
Nao-chan, may I ask you something?

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:31.340
Huh?

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:35.720
Why was Shuu-chan running around naked in the house?

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:39.310
Don't tell me you guys did it!

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.930
D-Did what?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:43.770
This obviously!

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.400
Iroha-chan, that's nasty!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.400
Thank goodness! It doesn't look like you've gone that far yet.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.900
If you'll excuse me!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.530
Are you two playing doctor?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:01.160
He actually has a high fever.

00:17:03.710 --> 00:17:06.630
Who'd come at this hour? They're so thoughtless.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.500
Look who's talking, Iroha-chan.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.260
Forgive me for coming so late.

00:17:13.050 --> 00:17:18.220
I tried calling Takanashi-kun on his mobile, but he didn't answer, so I got worried.

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:21.310
Actually, my brother is in bed with a fever.

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.270
A fever?

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:27.440
I might have been the cause of his cold.

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:30.440
I have been calling him out at night a lot.

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.400
He's awake.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.160
Shuu-chan, are you OK?

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:39.990
Sorry for causing all this trouble.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:46.120
Oh yeah, are you hungry, Onii-chan? Should I get you some porridge?

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:49.630
Porridge? I guess I'll have a little.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.800
OK, wait here for a bit.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.440
He's sweating a lot.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.560
I'll wipe it off for you.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.020
Oh, Shuu-chan...

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:10.650
You're more muscular than you appear!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:17.700
That's right. He'll need plenty of fluids if he has a fever.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.320
I'll give you water from my mouth to yours.

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.740
Here's your porridge!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.010
Sorry, Shuu-chan!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.830
Are you OK, Takanashi-kun?

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:35.260
I heard a scream and came running up! Forgive me!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.050
Ah, so you're here too, Kondou?

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:44.890
I... uh... bought some pudding at the nearby convenience store.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.930
You can eat it if you like.

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.390
Ah, thanks.

00:18:48.390 --> 00:18:51.900
Onii-chan, you're going to eat the porridge I got for you, right?

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.400
Oh, thank you.

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:57.030
Here, Shuu-chan, say "ah"!

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.450
Iroha-chan!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.660
I'm only helping out since you're so busy, Nao-chan!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:05.660
Thank you! But your kindness is more than enough!

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:07.540
Onii-chan, say "ah"!

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:11.380
Give me that! I'm very good at feeding people!

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:15.210
Oh? I'm pretty good myself actually!

00:19:15.700 --> 00:19:16.960
Say "ah".

00:19:17.510 --> 00:19:18.720
She got us!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:22.640
Mine!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.050
What the-

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:26.930
Give it back!

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.810
You guys, that's not safe, especially with someone sick around!

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:42.110
I sense an ominous aura coming from that window.

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.800
It's probably the unsightly spitefulness between women.

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:47.730
Please protect me.

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:07.000
Now that you've taken your medicine, I'll sleep with you until morning!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.560
You mustn't. He won't be able to rest with the two of us here.

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.100
We'll be taking our leave.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:17.570
Ah, Shuu-chan! If you can't stand
sleeping alone, you can always call me!

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:20.710
You two, thanks for everything.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:27.080
And with that, Iroha-chan and Kondou-senpai finally went home,

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:30.580
but then I fell asleep.

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:35.200
I guess Operation Onii-chan's Heart-Pounding,

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:39.250
Sleepless Night: I'll Strike Him Half-Dead didn't go as planned.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:43.130
Oh, you're awake?

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.010
Yeah.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:49.510
I'm heading out now. You should stay in bed until Mum and Dad get home.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:53.390
Don't start messing with the computer just because your fever went down.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:56.520
And be sure to take your medicine when you eat your porridge.

00:20:56.520 --> 00:21:00.150
Oh, and be sure to change your pyjamas if you get sweaty.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.650
Understood?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.650
Weren't you listening? I told you to...

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:08.160
Oh, it's OK. All those words are making my head throb.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:11.160
And to think I was worried about you!

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:24.300
I'm off.

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:31.560
Onii-chan, you idiot.

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:35.270
Nao.

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.770
What are you doing? I told you to stay in bed!

00:21:40.270 --> 00:21:42.440
Thanks for taking care of me.

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:02.800
I don't like you at all, Onii-chan!
